{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01CSqNz6gwngS721PLKzyDKR","type":"tool_result","content":"--- FAIL: TestDelegateHandoffContinuesTheAttemptWithAnotherAgent (0.15s)\n    delegate_handoff_test.go:42: handoff: 1 {\n          \"command\": \"handoff\",\n          \"error\": \"the run history could not be read whole (unread: task runs: pose: /home belongs to another user; set XDG_STATE_HOME to a private directory of yours)\",\n          \"schema\": \"pose.delegate.error/v1\"\n        }\n         \n--- FAIL: TestDelegateHandoffRefusesAndIsBounded (0.16s)\n    delegate_handoff_test.go:89: first handoff: 1 \n--- FAIL: TestDelegateHandoffAutoRetryReturnsTheContinuation (0.14s)\n    delegate_handoff_test.go:185: handoff: 1 {\n          \"command\": \"handoff\",\n          \"error\": \"the run history could not be read whole (unread: task runs: pose: /home belongs to another user; set XDG_STATE_HOME to a private directory of yours)\",\n          \"schema\": \"pose.delegate.error/v1\"\n        }\n         \n--- FAIL: TestReviewRoundsContinueTheThreadAndAccountForFindings (0.30s)\n    delegate_rounds_test.go:132: wait: 1 {\n          \"command\": \"wait\",\n          \"error\": \"the run history could not be read whole, so the run's end cannot be told (unread: task runs: pose: /home belongs to another user; set XDG_STATE_HOME to a private directory of yours)\",\n          \"schema\": \"pose.delegate.error/v1\"\n        }\n--- FAIL: TestReviewRoundsRefuseAnIncompleteAccount (0.31s)\n    delegate_rounds_test.go:161: an invalid draft decided: 1 {\n          \"command\": \"wait\",\n          \"error\": \"the run history could not be read whole, so the run's end cannot be told (unread: task runs: pose: /home belongs to another user; set XDG_STATE_HOME to a private directory of yours)\",\n          \"schema\": \"pose.delegate.error/v1\"\n        }\n--- FAIL: TestReviewRoundsSurviveLossesAndResumes (0.16s)\n    delegate_rounds_test.go:202: ls text